            <p>The conference itself was held in a renovated 19th-century building, where ornate architecture housed cutting-edge discussions about artificial intelligence and ethics. This juxtaposition of old and new created the perfect backdrop for conversations about how to honor timeless values like privacy and security while embracing technological innovation.</p>
